WEBVTT

00:11:29.562 --> 00:11:32.206
building a drip castle, a sand castle.

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:35.646
And as she was there
on the edge of that stage,

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:39.007
two stagehands all in black

00:11:39.031 --> 00:11:43.511
with watering cans ran along the top

00:11:43.535 --> 00:11:48.138
and started to pour water
on the sand castle,

00:11:48.162 --> 00:11:50.908
and the sand castle
started to drip and sink,

00:11:50.932 --> 00:11:52.307
but before it did,

00:11:52.331 --> 00:11:56.547
the audience saw
the black-clad stagehands.

00:11:56.571 --> 00:12:01.134
The medium was apparent. It was banal.
We saw it.